		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Speaking at the Met Ball in New York this week &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;, wearing this figure-hugging dress by British designer Stella McCartney, told astonished red carpet reporters: &quot;I feel fat.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The 52-year-old star has always taken pride in her looks and follows a strict diet to keep her in top shape for her rigorous touring schedule but her admission that she’s sometimes unhappy with her body image shows that she could be human after all.&lt;/p&gt;
